  "id": "RAW_d9981f88",
  "title": "大圆实测 : 你真的需要一个长在企业微信中的 AI",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODYwMjI2MA==&mid=2649802499&idx=1&sn=5428fc3fdfc06b974e550f75d225d70a",
  "date": "2026-07-09 19:18:00",
  "author": "腾讯技术工程",
  "siteName": "腾讯技术工程",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=4a035f4a&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FKVER9adz907lJfrsZksPUeR7ocI04KCwsicynJyia8CC47JqbGNcSdQNGHhmrGgiapCH9MEFcpbQ837pBdjibfYHbp31uLpbuCgfO5NoQ6IlcK0%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">作者：蟹钳</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">昨天下午六点多，我在企微群里改一个方案，leader让我把最近这几天群内大家提的意见综合整理一下。我拿到这个任务的第一想法是让AI给我出个总结，但是以前这套AI协作的流程很割裂：信息在企业微信里，AI 在另一个地方。我得自己整理背景、确认内容、再把结果贴回文档里，最后还要重新调格式。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">晚上我就在想，这几年，头部AI模型几乎是一路猛打猛冲。写方案、做总结、生成PPT、图片设计等等垂直或者通用大模型的急速迭代早就让</span><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background: left top no-repeat rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);width: auto;height: auto;border-style: none;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);border-radius: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: inherit;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">AI+</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">办公从概念发展为一个迟早会落地的共识。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible;\">但问题也恰恰出在这里：AI的能力已经很强了，但是想让它协助解决一个具体的工作问题，总要先把群里的讨论、文档里的背景、任务里的要求重新整理一遍，再喂给它。麻烦的不是 AI 不会做，而是每次都要我重新交代一遍“事情从哪来、现在到哪了、我要它帮我做什么”。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">我越来越觉得：</span><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background: left top no-repeat rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);width: auto;height: auto;border-style: none;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);border-radius: 0px;font-weight: bold;color: inherit;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">AI办公的下一步，可能不是再多一个更聪明的对话框，而是让 AI 直接出现在你正在工作的地方。你在企业微信里聊项目、看文档、处理待办，需要 AI 时，左滑一下，它就出来了。</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">因此，在体验了即将上线的企业微信内置AI助手——大圆后，我第一反应是：它确实在朝抹平这段距离的方向努力。</span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:bold;border-left-color:rgb(3, 124, 230);font-size:18px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left-style:solid;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:24px 0px 12px;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;display:block;line-height:1.4;font-style:normal;border-left-width:4px;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 18px;line-height: 1.4;\">一个不一样的思路：AI不用你去找,它就在你正在用的地方</span></h2>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span aria-label=\"正文块内容区,undefined,文本\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">首先，大圆是直接嵌进企业微信里的。你在群聊里讨论项目，在文档里改方案，在待办里安排任务，它都在你的工作现场旁边，左滑一下它就出来了。以前用 AI，往往要复制聊天记录、上传文件、补充一长串背景，AI 才知道你要它做什么。但大圆不一样，它与你在企业微信里的工作上下文和记忆同频，不用你每次从头交代。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">这话听着有点玄乎,官方给的说法是四个核心能力，随时唤起、总结协作信息、读写文档、定时任务。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;margin:0px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;max-width:100%;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;widows:auto;text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;width: 656.997314px !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible !important;\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5d796749&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F8kOo4iaaOVgGfxUS0zmibSbMJBIStAGlIO2IozkYl6Ym73jcMGwrbjyKtMicnCic9wJVdQbqibGHTwbxzf47U9hHcmnR0eNruf1bmE8twHBQWjjY%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D1\"></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">听着挺美好，对吧，但这个嵌入式Agent实际用起来是什么感觉还得是实践出真理。于是我按照四大能力，一一对应设计了四个基础任务场景，一个一个来体验。</span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:bold;border-left-color:rgb(3, 124, 230);font-size:18px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;border-left-style:solid;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 12px;margin:24px 0px 12px;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;display:block;line-height:1.4;font-style:normal;border-left-width:4px;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 18px;line-height: 1.4;\">四个真实办公场景,把大圆放进去试一遍</span></h2>\n  <h3 style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;font-weight: bold;font-size: 17px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;display: block;color: rgb(3, 124, 230);line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.4;\">场景一：随时唤起,不退出群聊直接提问</span></h3>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">这个能力测的核心，不是<span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">能不能唤起</span>，而是<span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">唤起以后,它知不知道自己在哪</span>。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">我在一个日常的工作群内，没退出聊天界面，左滑，唤起大圆（这里不得不说在手机端操作的体感真的很丝滑），直接打了一句，群里聊了什么。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;margin:0px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;max-width:100%;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;widows:auto;text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;vertical-align:bottom;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;visibility:visible !important;width:100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=1085e5ef&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F8kOo4iaaOVgFEHQ6ODLm2IqDj7heuPN6mzjFib1cTsJ86zian6GicgI6SgfVmnbb9hNPQuiaACro9uKibX9iaIcnFiaiajCFU9sne2HyLELnPVlIRbwM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D2\"></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:no