ne-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.4;\">场景二：总结协作信息,项目群进展一目了然</span></h3>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">第一关只要求它<span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">找出来</span>，第二关要求它<span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\">理明白</span>。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">我挑了一个话题更杂、讨论周期更长的智能机器人协助的项目群，里面聊的东西五花八门，横跨了好几天的讨论。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;min-height:1em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0em;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;text-align:left;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:8px 0px;margin:16px 0px;letter-spacing:0em;text-decoration:none;clear:both;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;widows:auto;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;\">我直接问，群里聊了什么，需要我做什么。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"caret-color:rgb(62, 71, 83);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;margin:0px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;outline:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;max-width:100%;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:auto;widows:auto;text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" type=\"block\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;width: 656.997314px !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.8;visibility: visible !important;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a9b96c22&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_